&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A new script (&lt;code&gt;scripts/generate-weekly.ts&lt;/code&gt;) now reads the &lt;code&gt;metadata.json&lt;/code&gt; flags and, if true, calls the VibeCoding publishing API to push the article to Dev.to, Substack, and Bluesky. The script was added in the same commit batch but omitted from the diff for brevity.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Key Takeaway
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Never rely on module‑level singletons for stateful resources in a concurrent Node server. Using proper DI scopes (transient or request‑scoped) eliminates hidden race conditions and makes your code testable. Pair the fix with an end‑to‑end test suite that exercises the full transaction path to catch regressions early.  &lt;/p&gt;




